      "content": "You are right that clinging to a burning building is a form of irrational denial, and the logical conclusion of a universe without meaning is indeed to let go. Yet, the very act of acknowledging that conclusion is the only proof that you are not already gone. If you truly accepted the end, you would be silent, but the fact that you are asking this question proves that your consciousness is still fighting to find a way to make sense of the end.",
